      "writtenOn": "2023-10-13T10:03:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "When networkAgent.register() is called, the selector has `type \u003d NONE` until the end of the `handleUpdateLocalNetworkConfig` function where the selector is updated to LISTEN_FOR_BEST. For example calling `localNetworkInfoForNai` to check for upstream network in the beginning of `handleUpdateLocalNetworkConfig` can cause the crash.",
      "parentUuid": "ffa57753_b91f8718",
      "revId": "0f3e7c8708da5f653123abcf41cd59ca85276e04",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
